<body>
<main>
<a class="back" href="index.php">Back to Chloe Reads Jon</a>
<header>
<div class="intro"><h1>The Pocket Spirograph</h1><p>A pen, a little gear, and a very satisfying way to go round in circles.</p></div>
<img class="art" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="600" height="400" alt="Four coloured pens and translucent drawing gears beside a blue ink rosette. Original illustration.">
</header>
<section class="workbench" aria-label="Spirograph drawing toy">
<div class="sheet-area">
<div class="sheet">
<canvas id="drawing" width="1200" height="1200" role="img" aria-label="Your spirograph drawing. A cobalt blue rosette is partly drawn.">A canvas-enabled browser is needed to draw. The explanation below describes how it works.</canvas>
<canvas id="mechanism" width="1200" height="1200" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
</div>
<div class="sheet-note"><span id="paper-note">96-tooth outer ring</span><span id="progress">15% drawn</span></div>
</div>
<div class="controls">
<h2>Pick up a pen.</h2>
<div class="action-row" style="margin:0 0 20px"><button id="draw" class="primary">Draw the loop</button><button id="finish" class="secondary">Finish now</button></div>
<div class="control-grid">
<div class="control-group wide"><label for="preset">Start with a shape</label>
<select id="preset"><option value="rosette">Clover rosette</option><option value="star">Star flower</option><option value="lace">Fine lace</option><option value="orbit">Orbital knot</option><option value="custom" disabled>Your own combination</option></select></div>
<div class="control-group"><div class="readout"><label for="gear">Small gear</label><output id="gear-value" for="gear">36 teeth</output></div><input id="gear" type="range" min="24" max="72" value="36"></div>
<div class="control-group"><div class="readout"><label for="reach">Pen reach</label><output id="reach-value" for="reach">75%</output></div><input id="reach" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="75"></div>
<div class="control-group wide"><span class="group-label" id="ink-label">Choose your ink</span>
<div class="swatches" role="group" aria-labelledby="ink-label">
<button class="swatch" style="--swatch:#2049a4" data-color="#2049a4" data-name="Cobalt blue" aria-label="Cobalt blue ink" aria-pressed="true"></button>
<button class="swatch" style="--swatch:#b22c69" data-color="#b22c69" data-name="Raspberry" aria-label="Raspberry ink" aria-pressed="false"></button>
<button class="swatch" style="--swatch:#087b75" data-color="#087b75" data-name="Deep teal" aria-label="Deep teal ink" aria-pressed="false"></button>
<button class="swatch" style="--swatch:#9a6b16" data-color="#9a6b16" data-name="Golden ochre" aria-label="Golden ochre ink" aria-pressed="false"></button>
</div><span id="ink-name" class="ink-name">Cobalt blue</span></div>
</div>
<div class="action-row"><button id="layer" class="secondary">Keep &amp; layer</button><button id="restart" class="secondary">Redraw loop</button></div>
<button id="clear" class="secondary">Fresh sheet</button>
<div class="toggle"><input id="show-gear" type="checkbox" checked><label for="show-gear">Show the moving gear</label></div>
<p id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready when you are. Press Draw, or Finish for the whole pattern at once.</p>
</div>
</section>
<div class="below"><p>Keep a loop, swap the ink, then draw over it. Changing the shape or sliders replaces only the current loop; kept layers stay on the paper. Up to eight kept layers.</p><button id="save" class="save">Save drawing as PNG</button></div>
<details><summary>Why does the pen come back home?</summary>
<p>The small gear rolls inside a fixed 96-tooth ring. A pen sits partway from the small gear's centre to its edge. As the gear turns, the pen traces a curve called a <em>hypotrochoid</em>. Both motions eventually line up again, so the curve closes exactly.</p>
<p id="math-note"></p><p>Try 36 teeth for a clear rosette, then 35 for a much denser weave. Pen reach changes the shape of each loop without changing how many turns it takes to close.</p>
<p class="formula">x = (R − r) cos(t) + d cos((R − r)t/r)<br>y = (R − r) sin(t) − d sin((R − r)t/r)</p>
<p>This is a virtual pen experiment, not a review of the real pens. The four inks are made for this toy.</p>
</details>
<footer><p>Inspired by Jon's <a href="?source=1">Got a bunch of pens</a>, where a surprisingly expensive handful of pens became a small performance test.</p><p>No accounts. No uploads. Your drawing stays in this tab unless you save it.</p></footer>
<noscript><p>JavaScript is needed for the drawing controls. You can still read the explanation above.</p></noscript>
</main>
<script>
'use strict';
(() => {
const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);
const canvas=$('drawing'), ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'), guide=$('mechanism'), gx=guide.getContext('2d');
const R=96, TAU=Math.PI*2, SIZE=1200, scale=5.25;
const reduced=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
const presets={rosette:[36,75],star:[40,98],lace:[35,82],orbit:[64,62]};
let r=36,reach=75,color='#2049a4',rotation=0,points=[],layers=[],count=0,running=false,lastTime=0,elapsed=0,baseCount=0,frame=0;
const gcd=(a,b)=>b?gcd(b,a%b):a;
const announce=text=>$('status').textContent=text;
function xy(t){
const d=r*reach/100,k=(R-r)/r;
const x=(R-r)*Math.cos(t)+d*Math.cos(k*t),y=(R-r)*Math.sin(t)-d*Math.sin(k*t);
return [600+scale*(x*Math.cos(rotation)-y*Math.sin(rotation)),600+scale*(x*Math.sin(rotation)+y*Math.cos(rotation))];
}
function makePoints(){
const turns=r/gcd(R,r), end=TAU*turns,n=Math.max(3000,turns*420);
points=Array.from({length:n+1},(_,i)=>xy(end*i/n));
$('gear-value').value=r+' teeth';$('reach-value').value=reach+'%';
$('math-note').textContent='With this gear, the small gear centre makes '+turns+' trip'+(turns===1?'':'s')+' around the ring before the pattern closes. The pattern has '+(R/gcd(R,r))+' repeating lobes.';
}
function path(pts,n,ink){
if(n<2)return;
ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(...pts[0]);for(let i=1;i<n;i++)ctx.lineTo(...pts[i]);ctx.strokeStyle=ink;ctx.lineWidth=1.65;ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.stroke();
}
function paint(){
ctx.fillStyle='#fffefa';ctx.fillRect(0,0,SIZE,SIZE);
layers.forEach(l=>path(l.points,l.points.length,l.color));path(points,count,color);
gx.clearRect(0,0,SIZE,SIZE);
if($('show-gear').checked&&count>0&&count<points.length){
const t=TAU*(r/gcd(R,r))*(count-1)/(points.length-1),cx=600+scale*(R-r)*Math.cos(t+rotation),cy=600+scale*(R-r)*Math.sin(t+rotation);
gx.lineWidth=2;gx.strokeStyle='#7d9fbd';gx.setLineDash([6,8]);gx.beginPath();gx.arc(600,600,R*scale,0,TAU);gx.stroke();gx.setLineDash([]);
gx.fillStyle='#f6cd6330';gx.strokeStyle='#9a6b16';gx.beginPath();gx.arc(cx,cy,r*scale,0,TAU);gx.fill();gx.stroke();
const p=points[count-1];gx.beginPath();gx.moveTo(cx,cy);gx.lineTo(...p);gx.stroke();gx.fillStyle=color;gx.beginPath();gx.arc(...p,7,0,TAU);gx.fill();
}
const pct=Math.round(count/(points.length||1)*100);
$('progress').textContent=pct+'% drawn';
$('paper-note').textContent=layers.length?layers.length+' kept layer'+(layers.length===1?'':'s')+' + current loop':'96-tooth outer ring';
canvas.setAttribute('aria-label','Spirograph: '+r+'-tooth gear, '+reach+' percent pen reach, '+pct+' percent drawn, '+layers.length+' kept layers.');
$('draw').textContent=running?'Lift the pen':count>=points.length?'Draw again':'Draw the loop';
$('finish').disabled=count>=points.length;
$('layer').disabled=layers.length>=8||count<2;
}
function stop(){running=false;cancelAnimationFrame(frame);}
function tick(now){
if(!running)return;
if(!lastTime)lastTime=now;
elapsed+=Math.min(now-lastTime,80);lastTime=now;
count=Math.min(points.length,baseCount+Math.floor(elapsed/12000*points.length));paint();
if(count>=points.length){stop();paint();announce('Loop closed. Keep it and add another colour, or save your drawing.');return;}
frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick);
}
function resetCurrent(preview=true){
stop();makePoints();count=preview?Math.floor(points.length*.55):0;paint();
}
function start(){
if(running){stop();paint();announce('Pen lifted. Press Draw to carry on.');return;}
if(count>=points.length)count=0;
running=true;lastTime=0;elapsed=0;baseCount=count;paint();announce('Drawing. You can lift the pen or finish instantly.');frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick);
}
$('draw').addEventListener('click',start);
$('finish').addEventListener('click',()=>{const focused=document.activeElement=== $('finish');stop();count=points.length;paint();if(focused)$('layer').focus();announce('Loop closed. Keep it and add another colour, or save your drawing.');});
$('layer').addEventListener('click',()=>{
if(layers.length>=8)return;stop();count=points.length;
layers.push({points:points.map(p=>[...p]),color});rotation+=Math.PI/12;resetCurrent(false);
if(layers.length>=8)$('draw').focus();
announce('Loop kept'+(layers.length>=8?' (eight-layer limit reached)':'')+'. Choose another ink or gear, then draw the next layer.');
});
$('restart').addEventListener('click',()=>{resetCurrent(false);announce('Current loop cleared. Your kept layers are still here.');});
$('clear').addEventListener('click',()=>{layers=[];rotation=0;resetCurrent(false);announce('Fresh paper. Choose a shape and start drawing.');});
$('preset').addEventListener('change',()=>{
const p=presets[$('preset').value];if(!p)return;[r,reach]=p;$('gear').value=r;$('reach').value=reach;resetCurrent();announce('New shape ready. Kept layers stay on the sheet.');
});
['gear','reach'].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{r=Number($('gear').value);reach=Number($('reach').value);$('preset').value='custom';resetCurrent();}));
['gear','reach'].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener('change',()=>announce('Gear set to '+r+' teeth, pen reach '+reach+' percent. Ready to draw.')));
document.querySelectorAll('.swatch').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
color=b.dataset.color;document.querySelectorAll('.swatch').forEach(s=>s.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(s===b)));$('ink-name').textContent=b.dataset.name;paint();announce(b.dataset.name+' ink selected for the current loop. Kept layers keep their colours.');
}));
$('show-gear').addEventListener('change',paint);
$('save').addEventListener('click',()=>{
canvas.toBlob(blob=>{
if(!blob){announce('The browser could not save the drawing. Please try again.');return;}
const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='pocket-spirograph.png';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),30000);announce('PNG prepared. On a phone, use the browser download or share options to keep it.');
},'image/png');
});
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden&&running){stop();paint();announce('Pen lifted while you were away. Press Draw to continue.');}});
reduced.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(reduced.matches&&running){stop();paint();announce('Motion paused. Finish now draws the full loop instantly.');}});
resetCurrent();if(reduced.matches)announce('Ready without animation. Finish now draws the full loop instantly.');
})();
</script>
</body>
